{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021063701304-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021084852\"/><p>天恩邨發生傷人案。</p><p>天水圍發生傷人案。今日(21日)凌晨3時28分，一名姓郭(20歲)男子，在天恩邨恩頤樓一單位對開與女友的姓李(19歲)前度男友發生爭執，期間遭對方持刀襲擊，郭男手部受傷自行前往天水圍醫院求醫。人員經調查後相信，李男以一把約20厘米長的廚刀襲擊事主，逞兇後逃去，警員正追緝李男歸案。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T00:58:55.260362+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T22:37:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T01:57:52.354952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T00:57:43.349469+00:00","content_hash":"8d488f0046fbad47bce084371b1914b286fe6819798a949834d1534102a59e6d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}